mv — move or rename a file
=========================

Renames or moves a file from one path to another.

Usage: `mv <src> <dst>`

    module oskit.bin.mv

    import oskit.ulib.{puts, exit, rename}

    main(argv: []string)
        if len(argv) < 3
            puts("usage: mv <src> <dst>\n")
            return
        val result = rename(argv[1], argv[2])
        if result != 0
            puts("error\n")
